&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>弱光视觉增强</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/low-light/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/low-light/</guid><description>&lt;p>面向低照度、复杂光照等降质场景，研究视觉信息的恢复、增强与鲁棒感知。&lt;/p>
