&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>深度估计</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/depth/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/depth/</guid><description>&lt;p>面向常规与降质场景，研究单目及事件相机条件下的三维深度感知方法。&lt;/p>
