&lt;li>事件相机深度估计与多模态融合&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>人体动作识别</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/action/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/research/action/</guid><description>&lt;p>面向人体行为理解，研究基于骨骼点与视觉特征的动作识别方法。&lt;/p>
