&lt;ul>
&lt;li>基于骨骼点的人体动作识别&lt;/li>
&lt;li>动作序列建模与时空特征学习&lt;/li>
&lt;li>真实场景下的鲁棒行为理解&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul></description></item><item><title>登终南·望群峰——记实验室南五台秋日团建活动</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/</link><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/</guid><description>&lt;p>
&lt;figure class="lab-content-figure" >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100">&lt;img alt="登山合影"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/01_hu13500003075733919604.webp 400w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/01_hu8872946008572320877.webp 760w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/01_hu4486912145682892182.webp 1200w"
sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/01_hu8872946008572320877.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>秋日登高，尽览终南秀色&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>南五台作为终南山的著名胜景，以“奇峰、古寺、云海、秋色”闻名。活动当日，天高云淡，微风拂面，正是登高的好时节。大家沿着山径拾级而上，虽山路蜿蜒、台阶陡峭，但成员们相互鼓励、彼此扶持，一路欢声笑语，共同向山顶进发。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure class="lab-content-figure" >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100">&lt;img alt="风景1"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu14661443526037541489.webp 400w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11500582303907431924.webp 760w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11889756189606059387.webp 1200w"
sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/02_hu11500582303907431924.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>行至高处，远眺层峦叠嶂，群山连绵，秋叶斑斓，云雾缭绕间尽显终南山的壮阔与灵秀。山顶红墙金顶的古建筑在苍翠与秋黄的交织中格外醒目，大家纷纷驻足，用镜头记录下这秀美的自然风光与攀登的喜悦。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>
&lt;figure class="lab-content-figure" >
&lt;div class="d-flex justify-content-center">
&lt;div class="w-100">&lt;img alt="风景2"
srcset="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu1463548463833267012.webp 400w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu15002009858470253597.webp 760w, https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu13569210580765048330.webp 1200w"
sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px"
src="https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/lab_xiao/post/south-wutai-zhongnan-mountains/03_hu15002009858470253597.webp"
width="760"
height="570"
loading="lazy"
decoding="async"
data-zoomable />&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;/figure>
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>合影留念，定格青春时光&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>在“终南山·南五台”标志牌前，全体成员合影留念。大家比出大拇指，笑容灿烂，展现了实验室团队蓬勃向上的朝气与团结奋进的精神面貌。正如标志牌上“我愿和你在此许下海誓山盟”的浪漫寓意，这次攀登也见证了大家携手同行的深厚情谊。前排成员手持的绿色对勾标识，更象征着我们科研路上“攻坚克难、使命必达”的坚定信念。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>凝心聚力，共赴科研新程&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;p>“会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。”此次南五台之行，不仅让大家在繁忙的科研学习之余放松了身心，领略了大自然的壮美，更在攀登中磨砺了意志，增强了实验室的向心力。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>未来，实验室全体成员将继续保持这份攀登的勇气与协作的默契，在科研道路上勇攀高峰，再创佳绩！&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>联系</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/contact/</link><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/contact/</guid><description/></item><item><title>全国高校网络文化技术创新大会自主研发应用二等奖</title><link>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/award/china-boguan-2026/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://tianyx325.github.io/lab_xiao/award/china-boguan-2026/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;strong>奖项名称&lt;/strong>：全国高校网络文化技术创新大会自主研发应用二等奖&lt;br>
